<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 136-7 V INDIA - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 136-7 V INDIA - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa, needing 356 to win, were 136-7 at the resheduled tea interval on the rain-hit fifth and last day of the third and final test against India on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 410-9 and 266-8 declared, South Africa 321 and 136-7.</p>
